647	  // ciDispatchPlan block). AFTER the push, so the dispatched runs execute the
648	  // branch's own head; every delivering cycle, since a force-push emits no
649	  // synchronize event either and each new head needs its own runs. Best-effort:
650	  // a dispatch failure must not fail the converge that was already pushed.
