671	      // The base requires nothing, so auto-merge has no queue to wait behind and
672	      // the arm mutation would be rejected "clean status" — every cycle, no
673	      // setting to fix (#677). Skip the doomed arm; wait for this cycle's own
674	      // dispatched evidence and land on it, the same reasoning disposal uses a
675	      // day later. Delivery must land every cycle, not heal next cycle.
676	      console.log(`baselining: ${base} requires nothing to merge — skipping the doomed auto-merge arm;`
